In scope: Agree proposition and experience questions with consumers | set segment, behavior, and journey scope | select methods and research designs | set deliverables and timing
Out of scope: Supported decisions (consumers) | analysis (CM-1-3-1-3-3) | fieldwork procurement (operating model)"""@en ;
