    skos:definition "Offer design & development process consist of the elements of the go-to-market approach determined in the marketing operations strategy. It links the long-term strategy with the operational planning by detailing all strategic aspects (customer offer, sales channel & operations, distribution network)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme mod:core ;
